  "releaseNotes": "Touchscreen improvements: SwapXY/InvertX/InvertY and explicit axis range\n\t\t\toptions in DrmTouchOptions (plus DRMKIT_TOUCH_* env overrides),\n\t\t\tcalibration precedence fix (no more raw-as-pixels fallback),\n\t\t\tSYN_DROPPED resync with TouchCancel, final touch position on lift,\n\t\t\tper-device touch state.",
